  "details": "UI events provide the ability to pass values ​​to methods or script variables. But since udon has a slightly different structure, there is no way to pass arguments directly.\nIs it possible to add some components (setters) that will pass the argument value to the UdonBehaviour?\nSomething like IntSetter, StringSetter, BoolSetter, etc.\nThe code from the example can be found at pastebin: https://pastebin.com/uzSA3sAc \n\nBut this is a workaround, perhaps there are already more suitable ways to set values​​...",
